### 9. Impact and Significance

The proposed system helps educational institutions quickly understand student opinions by automatically analyzing large amounts of feedback. It reduces manual effort, identifies common problems, and helps teachers and administrators make informed decisions for improving teaching quality and student services. The project also demonstrates the practical application of NLP and AI in solving real-world problems in the education sector.

---

### 10. Deliverables

The project will deliver:

* An AI-powered Student Feedback Sentiment Analyzer application.
* A trained or integrated NLP sentiment classification model.
